      "text": "# dsh-whale-market bundle patch — mounts the Whale Market plugin into a dsh\n# host composition (any profile: desktop / web / tui …).\n#\n# Host half:  /plugins/dsh-whale-market/* HTTP surface (list / info / install /\n#             installed / set-enabled / update / uninstall) + Agent tools\n#             market_search / market_install / market_installed / market_update.\n# Browser half: 「插件市场」and「已安装」tabs in the Plugins settings section\n#             (settings.plugins.tab).\n#\n# Install (npm name, GitHub URL, or a local path — profile auto-detected by\n# the plugin itself, it installs new plugins into the profile it is mounted in):\n#   dsh plugin --profile <name> add dsh-whale-market\n# or mount a row by hand in any user patch layer:\n#   - insert:\n#       - id: whale-market\n#         name: dsh-whale-market\n#         config:\n#           profile: ''          # override auto-detected profile (optional)\n#           cli: ''              # override CLI binary, default tries dsh then whale\n- insert:\n    - id: whale-market\n      name: dsh-whale-market\n      config: {}\n"
